## Summary

This is a research-scale batch — Mathlib has **no** triangular-array CLT, so the load-bearing brick had to be built from scratch, and the three `Randomization` files sit on top of it. I landed every genuinely-closeable piece with verified builds and isolated the remaining debt precisely. I did **not** weaken any signature, hypothesis tag, or docstring, and did not launder anything into hypotheses.

